[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776826905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2776826905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2776826905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lgwQZ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T20:18:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T20:18:02Z","body":"If this is approved the way it is, ideally it should be documented on **CameraTexture**","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776826905/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780543864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2780543864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2780543864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lu7t4","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T07:58:23Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T08:04:30Z","body":"> This is not great, but I cannot think of a better alternative to fix the problem at the moment.\r\n\r\nIt could alternatively be a project setting whether to monitor feeds on startup (which is also respected by the editor, and would print a warning/error in output if you try using CameraTexture without the setting switched). Setting would be false by default.\r\n\r\nThat brings it more in line with other optional features that have a cost associated with just having them enabled (such as audio Enable Input, or enabling XR shaders)\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just saw this was discussed on the original PR already. IMO project setting is clearer and avoids confusing \"why does this work in editor but not in game?\" kinds of problems, but if the output logging is clear enough on what to do maybe it's fine to require user to toggle \"monitor feeds\" manually.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780543864/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803713537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2803713537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2803713537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nHUYB","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T03:57:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T03:57:25Z","body":"+1 to using a project setting as it's consistent with the behavior we have for other features that are similarly gated.\r\nWhile enabling automatically may be nice, it breaks consistency with our existing pattern.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803713537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804145674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2804145674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2804145674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nI94K","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T07:49:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T07:52:39Z","body":"I don't think enabling the monitoring of camera feeds in project settings is a good idea.\r\nAs explained in the [original PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104232), it's an intrusive action that should only be taken when necessary. Not only because it's slow, but also because it's questionable an application is even _looking at_ camera feeds when it doesn't need them.\r\nSay you're making an application that has a 'video chat' feature. In this application, most times you're not using the cameras, so you should not be monitoring the feeds. Only when you're actually using the video chat should you be monitoring the camera feeds. And when you're hanging up the call, you should stop monitoring feeds again.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804145674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805541763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2805541763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2805541763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nOSuD","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T14:38:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T14:38:13Z","body":"> I don't think enabling the monitoring of camera feeds in project settings is a good idea.\n> As explained in the [original PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104232), it's an intrusive action that should only be taken when necessary. Not only because it's slow, but also because it's questionable an application is even _looking at_ camera feeds when it doesn't need them.\n> Say you're making an application that has a 'video chat' feature. In this application, most times you're not using the cameras, so you should not be monitoring the feeds. Only when you're actually using the video chat should you be monitoring the camera feeds. And when you're hanging up the call, you should stop monitoring feeds again.\n\nIn this case, why don't we always enable it automatically when `CameraTexture` is being used, regardless whether it's in the editor or not?\n\nWe follow a similar pattern for audio in Android, where the developer can manually request the audio permission before starting audio, but if not, we request it automatically when needed.\n\nThe same approach can be applied here by allowing the developer to start / stop monitoring manually if desired, but otherwise toggling it on automatically when needed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805541763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805587639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2805587639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2805587639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nOd63","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T14:42:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T14:42:11Z","body":"> In this case, why don't we always enable it automatically when CameraTexture is being used, regardless whether it's in the editor or not?\r\n\r\nI'd be OK with that. I'd prefer if developers have to consciously decide when to enable and disable, but automatically enabling on demand would certainly eliminate the discrepancy between editor and release.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805587639/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819296003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2819296003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2819296003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oCwsD","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T19:13:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T19:13:18Z","body":"> In this case, why don't we always enable it automatically when `CameraTexture` is being used, regardless whether it's in the editor or not?\r\n\r\nThis also makes sense to me","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819296003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825615289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2825615289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2825615289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oa3e5","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T22:18:53Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T22:18:53Z","body":"Alright, I've changed the PR to automatically enable monitoring when a `CameraTexture` is created, regardless of whether it is an editor build or not.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825615289/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830904452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104971#issuecomment-2830904452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104971","id":2830904452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ovCyE","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T16:42:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T16:42:11Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830904452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoora